{"title":"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/5/1f5f96076c8b4f81eb298919ede2bddb2396cbe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x^2 - 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"21\" />. Determine all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5f8d4e3cbdad426ad841d45f9afc8c4144f52e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(f(x))) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/e/f0e5aa4b975682cfc7025a54bae6029d86e16776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x))=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />. Then, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/9/dc95c5887b7e1d8dff4b9ffa5d43e2d976386395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c9fac2286b274c7f03d951bbdcb91f1a2f2946.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-2a-3=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Now, let's do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/e/f0e5aa4b975682cfc7025a54bae6029d86e16776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x))=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" /> and call <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dd65a0a6580067e26b86f8dc155dc8dd1a713ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> (so basically we are doing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e01ff820927634a38c1cd76026a6a50b5231a565.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(b)=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />). Here, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626beed3a7eee094ce4b6cf79a49d81669f72d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/700a65ba10a76d91e67fc7357e43b4cc3ce38f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-2b=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/579f0dc9385da31121ef583d03a181244f186ae8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-2b+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />. Here, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> is the only solution. Now, let's do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dd65a0a6580067e26b86f8dc155dc8dd1a713ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />. Here, because from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e01ff820927634a38c1cd76026a6a50b5231a565.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(b)=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /> we have the possibilities of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b841efe9b46bb53cf9b427dd75169a2bf037468.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1, -1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9ea40cedcf88f95e1f34604adccff8856d4ad26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=1, -1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/6283179fa4595e6767449620851a565d9b2d15a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db09587bb1b0e7ea4f4a33d513da3201d240fb7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/224ae5ff2e22575ba5a41f26a68c2c5fdc0d502d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df9c2a2af80fab786c74c046eab7eba121b1ddb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a0c63bd688e62d26179408e43463ca3137ca98c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2x-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />. Here, after applying the quadratic formula, it will give us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa03727c2ed61299b0f1ac12c31d2b2b22e262d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1-\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"21\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff31dacbe63b627ac836bf15b6bbb70bf1eb0b27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"21\" />, so our only possibilities are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9f43c5afc0fa605915a963206936b78d14c9b95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{3, -1, 1, 1+\\sqrt2,}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"139\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/918940900160f2f74cbb3d0449a8061c2681cf32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{1-\\sqrt2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"69\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~Yuhao2012 \n</p><p>~minor changes by Baihly2024\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M4gzTG8HnQ4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M4gzTG8HnQ4</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018011001\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 203/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6695/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.206      1 2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\n100.00%    6.206      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35929:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018011001 and revision id 279259. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}